cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AANCA, cite this software record and the dataset-specific sources listed in the repository."
title: "AANCA: Automated Auditing of Nucleus Class Annotations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Smogór"
    given-names: "Natan"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
repository-code: "https://github.com/Jaqwilk/AANCA"
url: "https://aancastudy.org/"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, non-diagnostic research prototype for ranking potentially
  inconsistent nucleus class annotations for qualified expert review using
  group-safe out-of-fold evidence. Current positive evidence concerns controlled
  label-noise transfer and does not establish natural pathologist-error detection
  or clinical utility.
